{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/InternalModule.html#Lean.Linter.InternalModule.internalModuleLinter\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">InternalModule</span>.<span class=\"name\">internalModuleLinter</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Command.html#Lean.Elab.Command.Linter\">Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Enables the Lean core `internalModule` linter, which warns when a module considered \"internal\"\ndeclares a declaration that is not itself \"internal\".\n\nThe intent is that declarations living in internal modules (for example, anything under the\n`Lean` namespace, or the `omega`/`grind` implementation modules) stay internal, rather than\nbecoming part of a project's public API by accident.\n\nThis linter is off by default and is not intended for use by non-core projects. It is a member\nof the `linter.coreInternal` set, so it can also be enabled via `set_option linter.coreInternal\ntrue`.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/InternalModule.html#Lean.Linter.InternalModule.internalModuleLinter","kind":"def","line":66,"name":"Lean.Linter.InternalModule.internalModuleLinter","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Linter/InternalModule.lean#L66-L90"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/InternalModule.html#Lean.Linter.InternalModule.isInternalDecl\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">InternalModule</span>.<span class=\"name\">isInternalDecl</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether `declName` is an \"internal\" declaration. ","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/InternalModule.html#Lean.Linter.InternalModule.isInternalDecl","kind":"def","line":60,"name":"Lean.Linter.InternalModule.isInternalDecl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Linter/InternalModule.lean#L60-L64"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/InternalModule.html#Lean.Linter.InternalModule.internalDeclNamespaces\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">InternalModule</span>.<span class=\"name\">internalDeclNamespaces</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A declaration is internal if it lives in (a namespace under) one of these namespaces. ","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/InternalModule.html#Lean.Linter.InternalModule.internalDeclNamespaces","kind":"def","line":57,"name":"Lean.Linter.InternalModule.internalDeclNamespaces","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Linter/InternalModule.lean#L57-L58"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/InternalModule.html#Lean.Linter.InternalModule.isInternalModule\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">InternalModule</span>.<span class=\"name\">isInternalModule</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mod</span> : <a href=\"./Init/